<title>USA: MOTOR RACING-DAYTONA 24 HOURS SPORTSCAR RESULTS.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-DAYTONA 24 HOURS SPORTSCAR RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTONA BEACH, Florida 1997-02-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of</p>
<p>the Daytona 24 Hours sportscar race ending on Sunday:</p>
<p>1. Andy Wallace/James Weaver (Britain)/Rob Dyson/Butch</p>
<p>Leitzinger/John Paul Jr/Elliot Robinson (U.S.) Ford	   690 laps</p>
<p>(2456.4 miles/3953 km. Average speed: 102.292 mph/164.618 kph).</p>
<p>2. Fermin Vele (Spain)/Andy Evans/Charles Morgan/Rob Morgan</p>
<p>    (U.S.) Ferrari							 689 laps</p>
<p>3. Wayne Taylor (South Africa)/Eduardo Dibos (Peru)/Jim</p>
<p>Pace/Barry Waddell (U.S.) Oldsmobile 672</p>
<p>4. Ralf Kelleners/Andre Arhle/Claudia Hurtgen (Germany)/Patrice</p>
<p>    Grouesllard (France) Porsche				     665</p>
<p>5. Harald Grohs/Arnd Meier (Germany)/Andy Pilgrim (U.S.)/Jochen</p>
<p>    Rohr (Germany) Porsche					     663</p>
<p>6. Hans Stuck (Germany)/Thierry Boutsen (Belgium)/Bill Adam</p>
<p>    (Canada) Porsche						     661</p>
